{%- comment -%}
  Maps a Design System cap key to a max-width value.
  Keys: none | wide | max | tv

  TV cap increased to 160rem (from 144rem) to accommodate font growth
  on ultra-wide displays (>2300px). Fonts grow to ~5rem via --tv-font-bump;
  160rem width (2560px) maintains readability at these scales.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- case key -%}
  {%- when 'wide' -%}90rem
  {%- when 'max' -%}120rem
  {%- when 'tv' -%}clamp(64rem, 88vw, 160rem)
  {%- else -%}none
{%- endcase -%}